flowchart TD
  A[Any recognized trigger] --> M[!CENTRALDARK]
  M --> W[#ACORDAR]
  W --> C[#CRISTALIZAR MEASURE/FALLBACK]
  C --> I[Parallel READ-ONLY inventory]
  I --> G[GitHub desired state]
  I --> H[Casa actual state]
  I --> V[VPS actual state]
  I --> D[Drive durable mirror/library]
  I --> P[Package capabilities]
  G & H & V & D & P --> R[Rendezvous + reconcile]
  R --> S{Material contradiction?}
  S -- yes --> X[STOP-WRITE / measure discriminant]
  X --> R
  S -- no --> O[Resolve existing owner]
  O --> K[One writer / minimum delta]
  K --> T[Tests + falsifiers + docs]
  T --> J[Reality Judge]
  J --> CI{Latest candidate HEAD green?}
  CI -- no --> F[Fix minimum / rerun]
  F --> T
  CI -- yes --> A1[Technical acceptance]
  A1 --> B[Sync derived Drive mirrors + receipts]
  B --> N[Handoff + NEXT_CURSOR]
